.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt BUFFER_GETLINE_SA 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm buffer_getline_sa
.Nd read a line from a buffer into a stralloc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In buffer.h
.In stralloc.h
.Ft int
.Fn buffer_getline_sa "buffer *b" "stralloc *sa"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn buffer_getline_sa
function reads a newline-terminated line from the buffer
.Fa b
and stores it into the dynamic string
.Fa sa .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 on success, 0 on end-of-file, or -1 on error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr buffer_getln 3